{"path":"chrono/year_month/year_month","title":"std::chrono::year_month::year_month","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::year_month::</span>year_month","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/year_month/year_month","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs a year_month object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">year_month<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">default</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> year_month<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year\"><span class=\"kw2636\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a <code>year_month</code> object.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Default constructor leaves the year and month uninitialized.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Constructs a <code>year_month</code> object storing the year <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">y</span></code> and the month <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>A more convenient way to construct a <code>year_month</code> is with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy2\">/</span></span></code>, e.g., <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">2007y<span class=\"sy2\">/</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2625\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">April</span></span></a></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/operator_slash\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator/</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  conventional syntax for Gregorian calendar date creation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year_month","title":"std::chrono::year_month"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::year_month::year_month","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Constructs a year_month object."},{"label":"Notes","note":"A more convenient way to construct a year_month is with operator/, e.g., 2007y/std::chrono::April."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator/","note":"conventional syntax for Gregorian calendar date creation"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":70,"codeBlockCount":0}
